    "row": 120,
    "htmlRowId": "1662574278R119",
    "text": "120 Hip-Fire Grip While hipfiring: 20% Increased Aim Assist Falloff Distance, Reticle Stickiness Falloff Distance, and Damage Falloff Distance. +15 Aim Assist, +2.7° Precision Angle Threshold , -30% Accuracy Cone Size and +25 Stability. Precision Angle Threshold does not prefer Precision Hits over Body Hits if both cones overlap. Shotguns , Sniper Rifles , Fusion Rifles, and The Last Word do not benefit from Damage Falloff Increases. Precision Angle Threshold cannot exceed regular Aim Assist Cone Size. ↑Stronger effect. Accuracy Cone Size remains unchanged.",
    "html": "<tr style=\"height: 149px\"><th id=\"1662574278R119\" style=\"height: 149px;\"><div style=\"line-height: 149px\">120</div></th><td class=\"s17\">Hip-Fire Grip</td><td class=\"s25\"><div style=\"width:70px;height:149px;\"><img src=\"https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLb4ioXlBZP4ryQtwoq56nHmAd7tzEo_ZpUGBYpHNynLSsddyb1Y2VFyUjDhfsu9ycOw4I_X_MGNZap7ySMJYkIUKls3nZWFvDQB08pe1Gwm3jEHczlEud_ef2bgF3fCTkvLix4OytAEO6YLma_maOxWTvmJtOqF_7Op=w70-h149\" style=\"width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;\"/></div></td><td class=\"s19\" colspan=\"4\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;\">While hipfiring:<br></span>20% Increased Aim Assist Falloff Distance, Reticle Stickiness Falloff Distance, and Damage Falloff Distance.<br>+15 Aim Assist,<span style=\"color:#f1c232;\"> +2.7° Precision Angle Threshold</span>, -30% Accuracy Cone Size and +25 Stability.<br><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;\">Precision Angle Threshold</span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;\"> </span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;\">does not</span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;\"> prefer </span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;\">Precision Hits</span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;\"> over </span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#999999;\">Body Hits</span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;\"> if both cones overlap.<br></span><br><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#93c47d;\">Shotguns</span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;\">, </span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#93c47d;\">Sniper Rifles</span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;\">, Fusion Rifles, and The Last Word </span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;\">do not</span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;\"> benefit from Damage Falloff Increases.<br></span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;\">Precision Angle Threshold</span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;\"> cannot exceed regular Aim Assist Cone Size.</span><br><br><span style=\"color:#ffd966;\">↑Stronger effect. Accuracy Cone Size remains unchanged.</span></td></tr>",
    "scope": "Base trait, while hipfiring; row has no separate PvE/PvP values. Enhanced effect excluded."
  },
